{"screen_name": "asulion54", "file": "asulion54-1f4338", "name": "あすとら", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1474789066940239872/0_IwN6cO.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2210113092/1686662317/1500x500", "description": "雑多垢。ふとったケモノ絵メインです。右固定、自衛してます。アイコンは蒼い鴉さん(@aoikarasu1562)からいただきました！🐧  Skeb (版権×):https://skeb.jp/@asulion54", "total_works": 16, "scraped_works": 16, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T21:46:05.760335+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T21:46:05.760335+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 9000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T21:46:05.760335+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 9000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 9000, "max": 9000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/asulion54", "name": "asulion54"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@asulion54/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/35f2b525/uploads/origins/9a61f23e-6816-4f70-9574-f20c8d752a58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b164274c59331f738ee41f67f6f90b8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35f2b525/uploads/origins/9a61f23e-6816-4f70-9574-f20c8d752a58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b164274c59331f738ee41f67f6f90b8, https://si.imgix.net/35f2b525/uploads/origins/9a61f23e-6816-4f70-9574-f20c8d752a58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ab6aa10e19cc02ea9c197ef46e53da7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35f2b525/uploads/origins/9a61f23e-6816-4f70-9574-f20c8d752a58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f422523ecdf03d66fbc8e940ab5c8ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。\nブラックドラゴンのデビルンに大量の空気を与えて、お腹を風船のように大きく膨らんだ姿を描いて欲しいです。細かい構図等はお任せします。  \nお手数ですが、宜しくお願いします。  \n\n参考資料 \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lIqliMxlO0jZ0LO6XUmzujgF3_6NG5bW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asulion54/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef1ba9af/uploads/origins/6ff2fe51-bec1-403d-8ac5-1ccb33e6bad7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1bcac9c9add23a12b3195348e62bb0d7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ef1ba9af/uploads/origins/6ff2fe51-bec1-403d-8ac5-1ccb33e6bad7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1bcac9c9add23a12b3195348e62bb0d7, https://si.imgix.net/ef1ba9af/uploads/origins/6ff2fe51-bec1-403d-8ac5-1ccb33e6bad7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e27541a1c93a1a5acae6c3838f75d6d7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ef1ba9af/uploads/origins/6ff2fe51-bec1-403d-8ac5-1ccb33e6bad7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd04ce59def0d4ecf59504a9225b00ad 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi. I hope 柴郡 is fatten up like a ball.\nAnd he will enjoy his big soft belly.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/iIVNjRD", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asulion54/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/34017796/uploads/origins/d9967d03-92f4-4a09-b483-a29e837d987d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f7120b71510b1b334d465486b6e8ce7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/34017796/uploads/origins/d9967d03-92f4-4a09-b483-a29e837d987d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f7120b71510b1b334d465486b6e8ce7, https://si.imgix.net/34017796/uploads/origins/d9967d03-92f4-4a09-b483-a29e837d987d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00269c9652bb32aa369807b3223461d4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/34017796/uploads/origins/d9967d03-92f4-4a09-b483-a29e837d987d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61e60e862eb871cb27b52e6ce89497d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵がとても好きなので、私のスカルドラゴンのキャラクターを描いていただけないでしょうか！彼はくつろいでいて、背もたれに寄りかかり、大きな柔らかいお腹を見せながらクッキーを楽しんでいたりします。\n\n彼はこのジャケットを着ることができます: https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/7hv4tibky3n17vj95ppyz/Sneeve-Jacket-Red.png?rlkey=bm8t82nr0a4qydyh2blq6s2ua&st=2vvawpyy&dl=0\n\n好きなだけ大きくしてください！\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/0posgv5imuapm1po1upon/Skulldragon-Sneeve-Ref.png?rlkey=09q8cosb8adw4jw5q3ixnub6t&st=pv3i25fd&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asulion54/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e8ae38d/uploads/origins/03a0e381-1720-4777-b019-3ecb74b2efe6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d824b5da77f580072db224f857138c2e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e8ae38d/uploads/origins/03a0e381-1720-4777-b019-3ecb74b2efe6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d824b5da77f580072db224f857138c2e, https://si.imgix.net/0e8ae38d/uploads/origins/03a0e381-1720-4777-b019-3ecb74b2efe6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e56be1db33eda2c184b9fe264af81cc6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e8ae38d/uploads/origins/03a0e381-1720-4777-b019-3ecb74b2efe6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adbb11ff693c07deb00af92eac2c0d4e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！今回は私の代理キャラクターのデブイラストをお願いしたいと思います。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xH1YoHKIlTdPm54Wu_39a5Kb_8AYTgma?usp=sharing\n\n希望する体型はこのくらいのイメージで、照れている表情、または少し慌てている表情にしていただければ嬉しいです。https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CwRxMn1bzxAAlUfW7A4HsqYYizy40PfY/view?usp=sharing\n\n\n顔の部分には過度に肉を付けすぎないようにしていただきたいです。\n少しはアーティスト様の感覚でアレンジして表現していただいても大丈夫ですので、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asulion54/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce22bcd8/uploads/origins/f1bd649a-77bd-4f5f-9679-d9ccb559947d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=848c5c3b19f945d45cabf8dbfc4e044c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce22bcd8/uploads/origins/f1bd649a-77bd-4f5f-9679-d9ccb559947d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=848c5c3b19f945d45cabf8dbfc4e044c, https://si.imgix.net/ce22bcd8/uploads/origins/f1bd649a-77bd-4f5f-9679-d9ccb559947d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59237457640a0d2d1f1ac0ba0d98eaf4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce22bcd8/uploads/origins/f1bd649a-77bd-4f5f-9679-d9ccb559947d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e109c25d9ba7e743edcc4dbf531f689c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! If it is possible I would love to see your take on the blue characters stomach growing very large due to over eating. \n\nA concerned expression on his face had he holds his large stomach with both hands thinking of how much he has eaten in the past to grow so large would be very cute! \n\nThank you very much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/0tvje5y8isp1rhb9z0u7f/AGfQpmbD5RJScm5lkjdGViY?rlkey=730yiaodq7dujxawpfvfc43co&st=vzp2p0re&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asulion54/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/abc6ffee/uploads/origins/80b8b788-09e7-48c4-85bf-b3d0cbd1355b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f08050ae629d702892177952f9a9fcc3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/abc6ffee/uploads/origins/80b8b788-09e7-48c4-85bf-b3d0cbd1355b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f08050ae629d702892177952f9a9fcc3, https://si.imgix.net/abc6ffee/uploads/origins/80b8b788-09e7-48c4-85bf-b3d0cbd1355b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2dbca26b153222e59e855e914a7334a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/abc6ffee/uploads/origins/80b8b788-09e7-48c4-85bf-b3d0cbd1355b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4ab6af138c4c8c86b08a07549e62ee6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、リクエストお願いします。\n\nうちの子ヴォルグ先生（https://hub.vroid.com/characters/1324722638195405133/models/3439028237169843073）メロンパンを幸せそうに頬張りながら食べている感じでお願いします。ポーズは仰向けで\n\nhttps://hub.vroid.com/characters/1324722638195405133/models/3439028237169843073", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asulion54/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee96ad64/uploads/origins/51638810-ea43-48da-a115-1feb6ee884b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fd22463b14252eae2c543add5b8e6df", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ee96ad64/uploads/origins/51638810-ea43-48da-a115-1feb6ee884b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fd22463b14252eae2c543add5b8e6df, https://si.imgix.net/ee96ad64/uploads/origins/51638810-ea43-48da-a115-1feb6ee884b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=211dbf95d1282e1f1c5a842926be1152 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ee96ad64/uploads/origins/51638810-ea43-48da-a115-1feb6ee884b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7cf29e2a98ee5cb1f507e60381293f1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "またまたこんにちは！前回いただいた作品、とても気に入っています！今回は私の鳥のキャラクター、ビスケットの絵をお願いします！本当に太っていて、大きな丸いお腹でシャツのボタンを留めるのに苦労しているところを描いてほしいです（このサイズかそれ以上：https://www.furaffinity.net/view/56022278/ ）！嘴にお菓子をくわえて、戸惑っているような、ちょっと慌てたような表情でもいいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Gtrga1e-j5V4o4rdKtISlh51wlpeP3kG/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asulion54/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/38495ac0/uploads/origins/f9f24027-bd24-417e-925e-01440ac39ae2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=095042a991f5893a711c5c1f1eef1bd2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38495ac0/uploads/origins/f9f24027-bd24-417e-925e-01440ac39ae2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=095042a991f5893a711c5c1f1eef1bd2, https://si.imgix.net/38495ac0/uploads/origins/f9f24027-bd24-417e-925e-01440ac39ae2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&f